```
  Five keywords mapping:
    try    { ... }                 // guarded block
    catch  (SpecificException e)   // handle, most-specific first
    finally{ ... }                 // cleanup (except System.exit/JVM crash)
    throw  new DomainException(c)  // raise now
    throws DomainException         // declare to caller

